  "gameplay": {
    "mechanic": "catch",
    "core_loop": "Catch campaign tokens, open the presenter chat and ask a question. Every page load starts with Kai, Command Hub and the identity-safe Kai hybrid renderer. The public package uses the existing Kai sprite and registered whole-face frame for local preview; it contains no Cubism Core, Mao sample model or authorized Kai moc3.",
